 "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1729771404, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "22654746", "format": "epub", "version": 323672819, "soldout": 1, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/24/YueWen_22654746/s_YueWen_22654746.jpg", "title": "温高力高尔夫教程", "author": "温高力", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 82, "chapterTitle": "12.5 直角训练器Right Angle", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7V9t6iRFx", "review": {"bookId": "22654746", "content": "所以想要保持稳定，上杆时左臂就要伸直。但这并不是必须的，可以稍微弯曲增加杠杆。", "bookVersion": 697119632, "range": "607-673", "abstract": "如果上杆时左臂明显弯曲，这会变成三杠杆挥杆。在高尔夫挥杆中，我们增加越多的杠杆，潜在的能量就越大，但是同时挥杆也会更难以控制和协调。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 49, "reviewId": "17408780_7V9t6iRFx", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1729650635, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "22654746", "format": "epub", "version": 323672819, "soldout": 1, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/24/YueWen_22654746/s_YueWen_22654746.jpg", "title": "温高力高尔夫教程", "author": "温高力", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 49, "chapterTitle": "6.4 杠杆作用Leverage", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7V9lOxIyb", "review": {"bookId": "22654746", "content": "什么技巧都不能违背物理定律。", "bookVersion": 697119632, "range": "5600-5784", "abstract": "牛顿第三运动定律放到这项运动中可以解释为“每一个动作的作用力都有一个与它相同的反作用力”，因此问题就是你上杆时向内挥杆越多，你在下杆时就越有可能向外挥杆以作代偿。\n \n所以下次再有人告诉你上杆向内一些时，你就想想牛顿是怎么说的。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 46, "reviewId": "17408780_7V9lOxIyb", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1729643959, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "22654746", "format": "epub", "version": 323672819, "soldout": 1, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/24/YueWen_22654746/s_YueWen_22654746.jpg", "title": "温高力高尔夫教程", "author": "温高力", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 46, "chapterTitle": "第6章 Physics & Geometry of the Golf Swing挥杆物理和几何学", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7V8dxs7v5", "review": {"bookId": "22654746", "content": "这里颠覆了我的认知，原来我一直强迫自己盯在球上，注意力集中。", "bookVersion": 697119632, "range": "5081-5218", "abstract": "因此对于手眼配合得很好的高尔夫球手来说，在击球时没有实际的必要去看球，也没有必要专注于球。事实上在没有看球的情况下击球是相对容易的，你闭着眼睛击球也没有那么难。这并不是说我让你在下杆时看着天空，我所提倡的是在你击球时让眼睛自然地随着身体旋转和球杆运动，就像在其他运动中一样。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 45, "reviewId": "17408780_7V8dxs7v5", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1729579577, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "22654746", "format": "epub", "version": 323672819, "soldout": 1, "bookS